_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/89007590a7b03bcc60ee0f4d20a7bf85.mp4?t=1754486894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">If you were with us during early access or just picking up the game now, we thank you for playing<br><br><strong>Thanks for joinin\u2019 da Speedwaaagh! Be sure to jump on the official Speed Freeks Discord server to chat and play with other gits!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
